2 to \eqn{n - 1} lineages are events and the last interval, from the most
recent split to the present, is not; \eqn{r} is profiled out (its maximum
likelihood value is \eqn{(n - 2) / \sum_k k^{1 + c} g_k}{(n - 2) / sum_k
